# Testing

- Every behavior change must include or update a test
- Run the full test suite before marking a bead done
- Prefer unit tests for logic, integration tests for CLI/scripts
- Test files live alongside or in a `tests/` directory within `harness/`

## Before Marking Done

1. All tests pass
2. Bead validator passes (once FACTORY-001 is complete)
3. No linter errors in changed files
